### Pre-Completion Checklist

Before attempting completion, verify:
- [ ] All acceptance criteria have concrete evidence (tests pass, output shown)
- [ ] Linter passes: `ruff check <changed_files>` with no errors
- [ ] All changes committed: `git status` shows clean working tree

If any check fails, fix it first.

